From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glacier <hyouga.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 08:55:06 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Answer isBlockTickPending from a membership mirror

isBlockTickPending asked pendingTickListEntriesThisTick, an ArrayList, for containment.
Repeaters and comparators do that on every neighbour update, while the list holds up to
tickNextTickCap entries.

The entries all come out of pendingTickListEntriesTreeSet, which is a Set, so the list
never holds two entries equal by NextTickListEntry.equals and a plain HashSet answers
exactly what List.contains answered. The mirror is kept in step at the two adds and the
removal loop in tickUpdates, the clear at the end of it, and the removal loop in
a(StructureBoundingBox, boolean).

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/WorldServer.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/WorldServer.java
index c1b545747c7a91c4139972d59650cc286944b832..06d43b4d2b6b50458aeb832569b1a85b51445ef9 100644
